<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University! We do not offer an undergraduate degree in physical therapy, but we have a <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/NUKINBS/undergrad/false">BS in kinesiology</a>, which is a good foundation to use to pursue a graduate program in physical therapy. Another program that may interest you is the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/ECEXWBS/undergrad/false">BS in exercise and wellness</a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">I encourage you to view the <a href="http://www.bls.gov/ooh/healthcare/physical-therapists.htm">Bureau of Labor and Statistics website</a>, which can be very useful when looking into a particular career path. You can view relevant information on physical therapy qualifications, job outlook, earnings, etc. You may also want to check out the <a href="http://www.apta.org/PTEducation/Overview/">American Physical Therapy Association</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">To receive guidance on declaring a major and what else you can do to prepare for a physical therapy program, I invite you to speak with an advisor in our pre-health department. You can reach an advisor at 480-965-2365 or <a href="http://prehealth.asu.edu/connect/advising">online</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div>Sincerely,</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}<br></font><br></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><br></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>